{"path":"content/holloweensub/holloweensub_ev1010_02","commands":[{"class":"NaniSummary","line":0,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"마법무녀 홍접, 원령들을 퇴치해라!\n물론 패배 능욕씬도 빼놓을 수 없지.","en":"Magical Shrine Maiden Kouchou, exorcise the Aberrant Spirits!\nOf course, you can't leave out the defeat and humiliation scene.","ja":"魔法巫女コウチョウ、怨霊たちを退治しろ！\nもちろん敗北凌辱シーンも外せないな。","zh-Hans":"魔法巫女红蝶，去消灭异形灵吧！\n当然，战败凌辱戏份也不能少。","zh-Hant":"魔法巫女紅蝶，消滅異形靈吧！\n當然戰敗凌辱橋段也是少不了的。","th":"มิโกะเวทมนตร์โคโจ จงกำราบพวกวิญญาณวิปริตซะ!\nแน่นอนว่าฉากพ่ายแพ้แล้วโดนย่ำยีก็ขาดไม่ได้ล่ะนะ","es":"¡Sacerdotisa mágica Kouchou, derrota a los espíritus aberrantes!\nPor supuesto, la escena de humillación tras la derrota no puede faltar."}}},{"class":"TitleCommand","line":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"PlayBgm","line":2,"fields":{"BgmPath":"bgm_story_001","Duration":"2","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"1","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"HideAllActors","line":3,"fields":{"Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":4,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":5,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Origin":"ghost_specter"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":6,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","Origin":"ghost_specter"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":7,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","Origin":"ghost_specter"}},{"class":"ModifyBackground","line":8,"fields":{"Duration":"0.3","Wait":"true","AppearanceAndTransition":"BG_Festivalstreet_Halloween","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PlaceCommand","line":9,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"천등가","en":"Sky Lantern Street","ja":"天灯街","zh-Hans":"天灯街","zh-Hant":"天燈街","th":"ถนนโคมลอย","es":"Calle de las Linternas Celestes"}}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":10,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":15,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0.3","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"40,50,10","IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":16,"fields":{"Visible":"false","Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0","ScenePosition":"23,50,12","IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":17,"fields":{"Visible":"false","Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0","ScenePosition":"7,50,10","IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":18,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","Duration":"0.3","Wait":"true","ScenePosition":"74,50,25","IdAndAppearance":"quartet_attendant_a.default","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":19,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","Duration":"0.3","Wait":"true","ScenePosition":"92,50,10","IdAndAppearance":"quartet_attendant_b.default","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":20,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Wait":"false","Power":"1.5","Duration":"0.3","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":21,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.2"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":22,"fields":{"ActorIds":"quartet_attendant_a"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":23,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"quartet_attendant_a.surprise","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":24,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":25,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":26,"fields":{}},{"class":"SpawnBlur","line":27,"fields":{"Wait":"true","ActorId":"BG_Festivalstreet_Halloween","Intensity":"0.5","FadeDuration":"0.3"}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":28,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExCenterSubtitle","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":29,"fields":{"Text":"","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"원령들이 인형극을 방해하고 있다.","texts":{"en":"Aberrant spirits are disrupting a puppet show.","ja":"怨霊たちが人形劇の邪魔をしている。","zh-Hans":"异形灵正在妨碍木偶戏。","zh-Hant":"異形靈正在妨礙人偶劇的演出。","th":"พวกวิญญาณวิปริตกำลังก่อกวนการแสดงหุ่นเชิด","es":"Los espíritus aberrantes están interrumpiendo una función de marionetas."}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":30,"fields":{}},{"class":"SpawnBlur","line":31,"fields":{"Wait":"true","ActorId":"BG_Festivalstreet_Halloween","Intensity":"0","FadeDuration":"0.3"}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":32,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExDialogue","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":36,"fields":{}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":37,"fields":{"Visible":"false","Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"quartet_attendant_a","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":38,"fields":{"Visible":"false","Duration":"0.2","Wait":"true","IdAndAppearance":"quartet_attendant_b","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":39,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"40,50,10","IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":40,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"23,50,12","IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":41,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"7,50,10","IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":42,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","Duration":"0","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"108,50,0","IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly.serious","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":43,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly","Wait":"true","Destination":"78,,0","Duration":"0.8","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":44,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":45,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"redbutterfly","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"배역이 없는 불청객들이 난입했네.","texts":{"en":"Uninvited guests... and there's no part for them in the show.","ja":"配役のない招かれざる客が乱入してきたね。","zh-Hans":"没有分配角色的不速之客闯进来了呢。","zh-Hant":"沒有被分配到角色的不速之客闖進來了呢。","th":"มีแขกไม่ได้รับเชิญที่ไม่มีบทบาทบุกเข้ามาซะได้","es":"Se han colado unos invitados no deseados que no estaban en el reparto."},"author":"redbutterfly"},{"class":"PrintText","line":46,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"redbutterfly","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"이래서는 인형극이 엉망이 되어버릴 거야.","texts":{"en":"At this rate, the puppet show will be ruined.","ja":"これじゃあ人形劇がめちゃくちゃになっちゃう。","zh-Hans":"这样下去木偶戏就要被搞砸了。","zh-Hant":"這樣下去人偶劇會變得一團糟的。","th":"แบบนี้การแสดงหุ่นเชิดก็พังหมดพอดี","es":"A este paso arruinarán la función de títeres."},"author":"redbutterfly"},{"class":"PrintText","line":48,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"뭐, 이런 것도 나름 괜찮지 않아? 참여형 연극이라든지.","texts":{"en":"Well, isn't this kind of neat in its own way? Like an interactive play or something.","ja":"まあ、こういうのも割と悪くないんじゃないか？ 参加型の演劇とか。","zh-Hans":"嘛，这样不也挺不错的吗？比如互动式戏剧之类的。","zh-Hant":"嘛，這樣不也挺不錯的嗎？像是參與型戲劇之類的。","th":"ก็นะ แบบนี้มันก็ไม่เลวไม่ใช่เหรอ? อย่างพวกละครแบบมีส่วนร่วมอะไรทำนองนั้น","es":"Bueno, ¿no está mal algo así a su manera? Como una obra interactiva, por ejemplo."},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":52,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly.closeeye","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":53,"fields":{"ActorIds":"redbutterfly"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":54,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"redbutterfly.silence","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":55,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":56,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":57,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"redbutterfly","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"원령들이 인형극을 이해할 수 있을거라는 생각은 안 하지만...","texts":{"en":"I doubt aberrant spirits understand puppet shows, but...","ja":"怨霊たちが人形劇を理解できるとは思わないけれど……","zh-Hans":"虽然我不觉得异形灵能看懂木偶戏……","zh-Hant":"雖然我不覺得異形靈能看得懂人偶劇就是了……","th":"ถึงจะไม่คิดว่าพวกวิญญาณวิปริตจะเข้าใจการแสดงหุ่นเชิดได้ก็เถอะ...","es":"No creo que los espíritus aberrantes puedan entender una obra de títeres, pero..."},"author":"redbutterfly"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":58,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly.question","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":59,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":60,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg1.chat","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":61,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":62,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"Wait","line":63,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.12"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":64,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":65,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"redbutterfly","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"어떤 건지 관심은 있는 것 같네.","texts":{"en":"They seem curious about what it is, though.","ja":"どんなものか、興味はあるみたいね。","zh-Hans":"看来对这件事情，还有感兴趣的。","zh-Hant":"看來對這件事情，還有感興趣的。","th":"ดูเหมือนจะสนใจอยู่ว่ามันคืออะไรนะ","es":"Parece que sienten curiosidad por ver de qué se trata."},"author":"redbutterfly"},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":69,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly","Wait":"true","Destination":",,-8","Duration":"0.35","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":70,"fields":{"Offset":"2,1","Zoom":"0.18","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":71,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"redbutterfly","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"내가 어떻게 하길 바래, <:player>?","texts":{"en":"What do you want me to do, <:player>?","ja":"私にどうしてほしいの、<:player>？","zh-Hans":"你希望我怎么做，<:player>？","zh-Hant":"你希望我怎麼做，<:player>？","th":"อยากให้ฉันทำยังไง, <:player>?","es":"¿Qué quieres que haga, <:player>?"},"author":"redbutterfly"},{"class":"AddChoice","line":73,"fields":{"ChoiceSummary":"","Lock":"0","AutoPlay":"1","ShowHandler":"1"},"loc":{"ChoiceSummary":{"ko":"정의의 편을 연기한다.","en":"Play the hero of justice.","ja":"正義の味方を演じる。","zh-Hans":"扮演正义的一方。","zh-Hant":"扮演正義的一方。","th":"แสดงเป็นฝ่ายธรรมะ","es":"Interpretar a los héroes de la justicia."}}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":74,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExDialogue","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":76,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly.embarrassed","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":77,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly","Wait":"true","Destination":"82,,","Duration":"0.4","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":78,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly","Wait":"true","Destination":",,-8","Duration":"0.35","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":79,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"2.5,1.3","Zoom":"0.22","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":80,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"redbutterfly"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":81,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"redbutterfly.sweat","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":82,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":83,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":84,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"redbutterfly","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"...진짜 해야 해?","texts":{"en":"...Do I really have to?","ja":"……本当にやらなきゃダメ？","zh-Hans":"……真的非演不可吗？","zh-Hant":"……真的非得演不可嗎？","th":"...ต้องทำจริง ๆ เหรอ?","es":"... ¿De verdad tengo que hacerlo?"},"author":"redbutterfly"},{"class":"PrintText","line":86,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"놀아주길 바란다면 그렇게 해 주자고. 손해보는 것도 아니잖아?","texts":{"en":"They want to play, so let's play along. What have we got to lose?","ja":"遊んでほしいならそうしてやろうぜ。損するわけでもないだろ？","zh-Hans":"既然它们想玩，就陪它们玩玩嘛。又不会掉块肉。","zh-Hant":"既然牠們想玩，那就陪牠們玩玩嘛。反正我們又不會吃虧。","th":"ถ้าอยากให้เล่นด้วยก็จัดให้หน่อยสิ ไม่ได้เสียหายอะไรสักหน่อยนี่จริงไหม?","es":"Si lo que quieren es jugar, pues juguemos. Tampoco perdemos nada, ¿no?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"PrintText","line":87,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"자, 정의의 마법무녀 홍접 나가신다!","texts":{"en":"Now, make way for Kouchou, the Magical Shrine Maiden of Justice!","ja":"さあ、正義の魔法巫女コウチョウのお出ましだ！","zh-Hans":"来，正义的魔法巫女红蝶登场！","zh-Hant":"來，正義的魔法巫女紅蝶登場！","th":"เอาละ มิโกะเวทมนตร์แห่งความยุติธรรม โคโจ ออกโรงแล้ว!","es":"¡Que pase la doncella mágica de la justicia, Kouchou!"},"author":"player"},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":91,"indent":1,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":92,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"redbutterfly"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":93,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"redbutterfly.sweat","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":94,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":95,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":96,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"redbutterfly","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"...","texts":{"en":"...","ja":"……","zh-Hans":"……","zh-Hant":"……","th":"...","es":"..."},"author":"redbutterfly"},{"class":"PrintText","line":98,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"대본 줬잖아? 대본대로만 해!","texts":{"en":"I gave you a script! Stick to it!","ja":"台本渡しただろ？台本通りにやればいいから！","zh-Hans":"已经给你台词本了吧？照着台词念就行了！","zh-Hant":"劇本不是給妳了嗎？照著劇本演就好！","th":"ก็ให้บทไปแล้วนี่? เล่นไปตามบทเลย!","es":"¡Te he dado un guion! ¡Tú solo cíñete al guion!"},"author":"player"},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":100,"indent":1,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"f