":"Apparently, they weren't satisfied with Kouchou's acting.","ja":"どうやらコウチョウの演技は満足のいくものではなかったようだ。","zh-Hans":"看来红蝶的演技似乎并不令人满意。","zh-Hant":"看來紅蝶的演技似乎不太令人滿意。","th":"ดูเหมือนว่าการแสดงของโคโจจะไม่เป็นที่น่าพอใจเท่าไหร่นัก","es":"Al parecer, la actuación de Kouchou no resultó muy convincente."}},{"class":"PrintText","line":152,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"홍접은 원령들에게 엉망진창으로 당해버렸다...","texts":{"en":"Kouchou was thoroughly ravaged by the aberrant spirits...","ja":"コウチョウは怨霊たちにめちゃくちゃにされてしまった……","zh-Hans":"红蝶被异形灵折腾得一塌糊涂……","zh-Hant":"紅蝶被異形靈給狠狠折騰了一番……","th":"โคโจถูกพวกวิญญาณวิปริตเล่นงานจนเละเทะไปหมด...","es":"Kouchou acabó sufriendo una tremenda humillación a manos de los espíritus aberrantes..."}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":153,"indent":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":154,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExDialogue","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":156,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"SetCustomVariable","line":157,"indent":1,"fields":{"Expression":"ev1010GhostResult=\"wrong\""}},{"class":"AddChoice","line":159,"fields":{"ChoiceSummary":"","Lock":"0","AutoPlay":"1","ShowHandler":"1"},"loc":{"ChoiceSummary":{"ko":"아군이 된 적을 연기한다.","en":"Play the enemy-turned-ally.","ja":"味方になった敵を演じる。","zh-Hans":"扮演成为友军的宿敌。","zh-Hant":"扮演化敵為友的強敵。","th":"แสดงเป็นศัตรูที่กลายมาเป็นพวกพ้อง","es":"Interpretar a un enemigo convertido en aliado."}}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":160,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExDialogue","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":165,"indent":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"Wait","line":166,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":167,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":168,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg1.question","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":169,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":170,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":171,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":172,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"아니 이럴수가! 축제를 위협하는 사악한 존재들의 등장! 정의의 퇴마사 일행은 이 위기를 어떻게 헤쳐나갈 것인가...?!","texts":{"en":"Oh, the horror! Evil creatures threaten the festival! How will our brave exorcists save the day?!","ja":"な、なんということだ！祭りを脅かす邪悪なる存在の登場！正義の退魔師一行はこの危機をどう切り抜けるのか……！？","zh-Hans":"哎呀，不得了了！威胁庆典的邪恶存在登场！正义的驱魔师一行究竟该如何度过这场危机……？！","zh-Hant":"哎呀，怎麼會這樣！威脅慶典的邪惡存在登場了！正義的退魔師一行人將如何度過這場危機……？！","th":"บ้าน่า เป็นไปได้ยังไง! ตัวตนชั่วร้ายที่คุกคามงานเทศกาลปรากฏตัวขึ้นแล้ว! เหล่าผู้ปราบมารแห่งความยุติธรรมจะผ่านพ้นวิกฤตนี้ไปได้อย่างไรกันนะ...?!","es":"¡No puede ser! ¡Aparecen seres malvados que amenazan el festival! ¿Cómo superarán esta crisis los exorcistas de la justicia...?!"},"author":"player"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":177,"indent":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":178,"indent":1,"fields":{"Visible":"false","Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":179,"indent":1,"fields":{"Visible":"false","Duration":"0.2","Wait":"true","IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":180,"indent":1,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"true","ScenePosition":"12,50,10","IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":181,"indent":1,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","Duration":"0","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"108,50,0","IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly.serious","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":182,"indent":1,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","Duration":"0.3","Wait":"true","ScenePosition":"74,50,25","IdAndAppearance":"quartet_attendant_a.default","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":183,"indent":1,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","Duration":"0.3","Wait":"true","ScenePosition":"92,50,10","IdAndAppearance":"quartet_attendant_b.default","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":184,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly","Wait":"true","Destination":"54,,0","Duration":"0.7","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":185,"indent":1,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":186,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":187,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg1.silence","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":188,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":189,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":190,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"0,1","Zoom":"0.14","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":191,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly.shy","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":192,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"redbutterfly","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"흐... 흥, 착각하지 마. 딱히 너희 편이 된 건 아니니까.","texts":{"en":"H-Hmph, don't get the wrong idea. It's not like I'm on your side or anything.","ja":"ふ……ふん、勘違いしないで。別にあなたたちの味方になったわけじゃないんだから。","zh-Hans":"哼……哼，别搞错了。我可不是特意来帮你们的。","zh-Hant":"哼……哼，少自作多情了。我可不是特地來當你們同伴的。","th":"ชิ... ชิ อย่าเข้าใจผิดไปล่ะ ไม่ได้จะมาเป็นพวกเดียวกับพวกนายสักหน่อย","es":"J-Ja... No te equivoques. No es que me haya puesto de vuestro lado ni nada de eso."},"author":"redbutterfly"},{"class":"CharacterGreetingCommand","line":193,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"redbutterfly","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.3","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":194,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"redbutterfly","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그냥, 너희를 쓰러트릴 건 나 뿐이야!","texts":{"en":"It's just that I'm the only one who gets to defeat you!","ja":"ただ、あなたたちを倒すのは私だけよ！","zh-Hans":"只是，能打倒你们的只有我而已！","zh-Hant":"只是，能打倒你們的只有我而已！","th":"ก็แค่ คนที่จะล้มพวกนายได้มีแค่ฉันคนเดียวเท่านั้น!","es":"¡Simplemente... la única que tiene derecho a derrotaros soy yo!"},"author":"redbutterfly"},{"class":"PrintText","line":196,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"오옷~! 여기서 마법무녀 홍접 등장! 싸움은 어떻게 될 것인가...?!","texts":{"en":"Ooh! Here comes Magical Shrine Maiden Kouchou! Can she turn the tide?!","ja":"おぉっ～！ここで魔法巫女コウチョウが登場！戦いは一体どうなってしまうのか……！？","zh-Hans":"哦哦～！魔法巫女红蝶在此登场！战况究竟会如何发展……？！","zh-Hant":"哦哦～！魔法巫女紅蝶在此登場！戰局究竟會如何發展呢……？！","th":"โอ้โห~! มิโกะเวทมนตร์โคโจปรากฏตัวขึ้นที่นี่แล้ว! การต่อสู้จะเป็นอย่างไรต่อไปกันนะ...?!","es":"¡Ooh! ¡Aquí hace su aparición la doncella mágica Kouchou! ¿Cuál será el desenlace del combate...?!"},"author":"player"},{"class":"Wait","line":201,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"PlaySfx","line":202,"indent":1,"fields":{"SfxPath":"SE_Cheer_03","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"0","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":204,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":205,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg1.harmony","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":206,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":207,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":208,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Wait":"false","Power":"1","Duration":"0.3","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterGreetingCommand","line":209,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"quartet_attendant_a","Wait":"false","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.4","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":210,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.15"}},{"class":